  "question": {
    "text": "<strong>Paragraph:</strong>\nConsider the polynomial $f(x)=1+2 x+3 x^2+4 x^3$. Let $s$ be the sum of all distinct real roots of $f(x)$ and let $t=|s|$.<strong>Question:</strong>\nThe area bounded by the curve $y=f(x)$ and the lines $x=0, y=0$ and $x=t$, lies in the interval",
    "image": null
  },
